				<pubDate>Thu, 28 Jun 2018 20:16:56 +0000</pubDate>
								<wikidot:authorUserId>4058903</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Not really that much to be said here. It's a nice example of the kind of cool low-key item that was more common in I and II, where the primary reaction after reading is &quot;Oh, that's nifty/horrifying!&quot; The note at the end didn't do much, but overall I found it pretty charming. +1</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
